                          "text":  "Two days later I rolled down a ramp and became the first wheeled rover on another planet. I am the size of a microwave oven and I am not fast. In my whole mission I drove about 100 metres, and I never went far from the lander.\n\nI visited rocks one at a time and pressed my instrument against them to learn what they were made of. The team gave them names like Barnacle Bill and Yogi. Meanwhile the lander took thousands of pictures and kept an eye on the weather.",
